The essential condition is unitarity: $U^\dagger U=UU^\dagger=\mathbf 1,
\qquad
U^{-1}=U^\dagger.$ This preserves inner products and therefore probabilities: $\braket{U\psi}{U\psi}
=\bra{\psi}U^\dagger U\ket{\psi}
=\braket{\psi}{\psi}.$

