p.src:
For distinct labels, $C_i^\dagger C_j^\dagger\ket{0}
=-C_j^\dagger C_i^\dagger\ket{0},$ which is the antisymmetry of the two-fermion state. The algebraic replacement $\begin{gathered}
\text{bosons: commutators}\\
\Updownarrow\\
\text{fermions: anticommutators}
\end{gathered}$ encodes the statistical distinction.

